@startuml OnboardingFlow
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FAFAF8
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam ParticipantPadding 15
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam defaultFontName "Plus Jakarta Sans"

title Peerly v2 — 5-Step Enriched Campus Onboarding & Verification Flow

actor "College / University Student" as Student
participant "UI Router\n(#/onboarding)" as UI
participant "Verification Engine\n(Simulated)" as Verify
participant "State Store\n(appState)" as State

== Step 1: Campus Selection ==
Student -> UI : Opens App / Taps "Get Started"
UI -> Student : Displays searchable list of colleges & universities\n(GLIM, IIT Madras, BITS Pilani, Ashoka, NID, IIMB, NLSIU)
Student -> UI : Selects campus (e.g., "GLIM")
UI -> State : Updates selected campus & institutional domain (@greatlakes.edu.in)

== Step 2: Campus .edu Email Verification ==
UI -> Student : Prompts for institutional email (@greatlakes.edu.in / .edu / .ac.in)
Student -> UI : Enters email & taps "Send OTP"
UI -> Verify : Sends 4-digit simulated OTP (Code: 4829)
Verify --> UI : OTP Dispatched with simulated toast
Student -> UI : Enters 4-digit OTP (Auto-advancing input boxes)
UI -> Verify : Submits OTP credentials
Verify -> Verify : Simulates validation spinner (600ms)
Verify --> UI : Email Verified Successfully
UI -> State : Sets user.verified = true

== Step 3: Background & Radar Interests Profile Setup ==
UI -> Student : Prompts Cohort Year (2026/2027),\nSpecialization tags (Engineering, Strategy, Design, Analytics, Finance),\nSkills offered (Python, UI/UX, Excel modeling, GTM),\n& Radar Target Interests (AI, Product, Consulting, Research)
Student -> UI : Selects tags & customizes profile
UI -> State : Stores user.batch, user.background, user.skills, user.interests

== Step 4: Student ID Upload (Optional) ==
UI -> Student : Prompts optional Student ID card upload\n(Unlocks "Verified Seller" badge & bulk exchange)
alt Student Uploads ID Card
    Student -> UI : Uploads/clicks ID photo (student_id.png)
    UI -> State : Sets user.isVerifiedSeller = true
else Student Skips
    Student -> UI : Taps "Skip for now"
    UI -> State : Maintains standard Verified Student status
end

== Step 5: You're In! (Personalized Access Granted) ==
UI -> Student : Displays celebration modal with "Verified Campus Student" badge\n+ Preview of tailored opportunities & peer matches
Student -> UI : Taps "Explore Campus Feed"
UI -> State : Calls completeOnboarding()
UI --> Student : Redirects to Home Feed (#/feed) with full 4-pillar privileges

@enduml
